      }
    },
    {
      "id": "semantic-zoom-specimen-notes",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Semantic Zoom Specimen Contract",
      "position": { "x": -500, "y": -40 },
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "ports": [
        { "id": "top", "label": "top", "direction": "input", "dataType": "value", "angle": 270 },
        { "id": "right", "label": "right", "direction": "output", "dataType": "value", "angle": 0 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "title": "Presentation Contract",
        "markdown": "# Semantic Zoom Specimen\n\nThis class exists only to prove semantic presentation.\n\n- **Icon** says `ICON` and shows the specimen marker.\n- **Summary** says `SUMMARY` and exposes the short summary.\n- **Detail** says `DETAIL`, exposes the complete diagnostic description, and lists the active band boundaries.\n\nNative Twilite rendering supplies glyph and dot levels."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "semantic-zoom-specimen-editor-view",
      "type": "port",
      "label": "Editor",
      "position": { "x": -440, "y": 300 },
      "width": 380,
      "height": 260,
      "ports": [
        { "id": "left", "label": "left", "direction": "input", "dataType": "value", "angle": 180 }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "view": { "intent": "editor", "payload": "editor.web" },
        "editor": {
          "web": {
            "fields": [
              { "key": "title", "label": "Title", "type": "text", "path": "data.title" },
              { "key": "marker", "label": "Marker", "type": "text", "path": "data.marker" },
              { "key": "summary", "label": "Summary Content", "type": "markdown", "path": "data.summary", "multiline": true, "rows": 4 },
              { "key": "detail", "label": "Detail Content", "type": "markdown", "path": "data.detail", "multiline": true, "rows": 6 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
